# Implementation Plan - Analytics, Bundles & Memberships

Following LMS industry best practices, this plan implements a scalable data aggregation system and a multi-channel monetization engine (Bundles & Subscriptions).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Module Creation**: I will be creating three new backend modules: `Analytics`, `Bundles`, and `Memberships`.
> - **Access Logic**: I will implement a centralized `CourseAccessService` to handle the complexity of checking direct purchases, bundle unlocks, and active subscriptions.
> - **Unlocked Logic**: As requested, buying a bundle will grant "Unlock Rights," but students will need to manually click "Unlock" on a course to start it (creating the actual Enrollment record).

## Proposed Changes

### Phase I: Analytics & Insights Dashboard
**Backend**:
#### [NEW] [DashboardController.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Admin/app/Http/Controllers/DashboardController.php)
- `getStats()`: Fetches Revenue, Active Students, and Completion Rates.
- Uses `Cache` with a 60-minute TTL to ensure the database remains fast at scale.
- Aggregates data from `Orders`, `Payments`, and `LessonProgress`.

**Frontend**:
#### [NEW] [dashboard/page.tsx](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/(dashboard)/admin/dashboard/page.tsx)
- Metric Cards with hover animations (KPIs).
- Recent Activity Feed (latest enrollments and sales).
- Course Popularity heat-map/table.

---

### Phase II: Course Bundles (Unlock Logic)
**Backend**:
#### [NEW] [Bundle.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Bundles/app/Models/Bundle.php)
- Pivot: `bundle_courses` linking Bundles to Courses.
#### [NEW] [BundlePurchase.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Bundles/app/Models/BundlePurchase.php)
- Tracks which student owns which bundle.
#### [NEW] [UnlockController.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Enrollments/app/Http/Controllers/UnlockController.php)
- Action: `POST /api/enrollments/unlock`.
- Validates bundle ownership and creates a standard `Enrollment` record for $0.

**Frontend**:
#### [NEW] [bundles/page.tsx](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/(dashboard)/admin/bundles/page.tsx)
- Admin UI to create and price bundles.

---

### Phase III: Memberships (Tiered Subscriptions)
**Backend**:
#### [NEW] [MembershipPlan.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Memberships/app/Models/MembershipPlan.php)
- Support for "Bronze," "Silver," and "Gold" tiers (Tier Level: 1, 2, 3).
#### [NEW] [CourseAccessService.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Courses/app/Services/CourseAccessService.php)
- Centralized check: `canAccess(user, course)`.

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `BundleTest`: Buying a bundle should grant unlock rights but NOT create an enrollment.
- `UnlockTest`: Unlocking a course within an owned bundle should succeed and create a valid enrollment.
- `AccessServiceTest`: Users with "Gold" membership should access "Silver" courses.

### Manual Verification
- **Dashboard**: Verify totals against database records using Tinker.
- **Student Journey**: Buy a bundle -> Navigate to course -> "Unlock" -> Start learning.
